> I want to build a neural network that predicts the next letter in a text. I have a data frame with the preceding 5 letters in lag1, lag2, ..., lag5, and the letter to predict in lag0. I tried doing this in R with the neuralnet library, but I get the error:
> Error in neurons[[i]] %*% weights[[i]] : 
>   requires numeric/complex matrix/vector arguments
> 
